                "text": "Because President Trump and Republicans chose tax cuts for billionaires over tax cuts for working families in their budget bill, heath care premiums under the Affordable Care Act are set to spike for people across the country.\n\nI visited Monadnock Community Hospital and heard about how these cuts will affect patients\u2019 access to care.",
